Z||000014||GTMike||10-31-2001||06:53 PM||||i'm thining of cutting mine too.  well not actually mine  junk yard springs.   if if mess them up i can just put my originals back on.  <P>to figure out how much i'm going to cut off. i'm going to drive the car up on ramps.  so i can get under itn and mesure on the spring how much needs to be removed to bring the car down 2 inches.   i figure if i like it  i just saved myself close to 200 bucks to put towards the 3.4 swap. ||||reg||1
